src/ui/ui.c:355 and src/shell/shell.c:196 compute the scale factor as 'dpi * scale / 100.0f' - the 100 is the scale's base percent, still a literal rather than a named constant. include/canlin/ui_limits.h now names the steps (CANLIN_UI_SCALE_STEP_100 and the rest, added in 6d5b78b) but not the base the factor is divided by. Found by the 2026-11-14 work on k110.
